# Live tenant/backup data (TENANT_DATA_ROOT / TENANT_BACKUP_ROOT default to
# ./data when run outside a bind-mounted host path). Per-tenant dirs are
# root-owned 0700 (see src/tenants/secrets.ts), so a non-root build even
# just *reading* them to tar the build context fails outright — and there
# is never a reason to ship live tenant data inside an image layer.
